{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<?ui-args --schema urn:example:ext=tests/ui/schemas/extension.xsd?>\n<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" xmlns:x=\"urn:example:ext\" initial=\"a\">\n  <state id=\"a\">\n    <transition event=\"go\" target=\"done\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"done\">\n    <donedata><x:note>reviewed</x:note></donedata>\n  </final>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml068-donedata-foreign-schema-invalid.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml068-donedata-foreign-schema-invalid.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":22,"endLine":7,"startColumn":16,"startLine":7}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<x:note>` is not allowed here inside `<donedata>`\n\n**Note:** the W3C SCXML 1.0 schema rejects this under XML Schema constraint `cvc-complex-type.2.4`: Element 'note' is not allowed at this position in the content model\n\n**Help:** `<donedata>` accepts `<content>`, `<param>` (each within its schema cardinality and order)\n\n**Spec:** XML Schema 1.0 Part 1 §3.4.4 Element Locally Valid (Complex Type) (`cvc-complex-type.2.4`)","text":"`<x:note>` is not allowed here inside `<donedata>`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":280,"start":274},"category":"schema"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"in the content of this `<donedata>`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml068-donedata-foreign-schema-invalid.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":14,"endLine":7,"startColumn":6,"startLine":7}}}],"ruleId":"XSD-cvc-complex-type.2.4"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"each SCXML element has a fixed content model; for example executable content belongs only in `<onentry>`, `<onexit>`, and `<transition>`"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: move the element to a parent that accepts it, or add the missing children.\n\nSpecification: XML Schema 1.0 Part 1 §3.4.4 Element Locally Valid (Complex Type)\n\nRun `scx --explain XSD-cvc-complex-type.2.4` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/xmlschema-1/#cvc-complex-type","id":"XSD-cvc-complex-type.2.4","name":"XSD-cvc-complex-type.2.4","properties":{"category":"schema"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a child element is not allowed at this position, or required children are missing"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}